{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_02",
  "title": "粗細有別",
  "storyCode": "RI-2",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6d281dcb5a7041a32f03b1943058d2e760299fe96fbee074b504c522b36d1781",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "這片雨林還是老樣子啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "text": "嘉維爾已經很久沒來過了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "我一直不喜歡這地方，空氣又潮濕，地又鬆軟，一點也沒有剛強的感覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "text": "不過現在有很多部族都搬進了雨林哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "text": "是這樣嗎？......啊，博士，你醒了，昨晚睡的還好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "還好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "適應力不錯啊，博士，還以為你肯定受不了在這種環境下露宿。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "哈哈，看你的眼神就知道了。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "我精神超好。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "嗯，如果你不一直揉額角的話我會相信你的。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "早跟你說了吧，博士，做好心理準備吧，接下來都只有這樣的環境了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "給，我用這邊能找到的素材做了點提神的湯，喝了吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "嘿，說起來，以前不知道，剛才在周圍轉轉才發現，這片雨林的藥用植物還挺多的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "......嘉維爾居然在照顧人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "嘉、嘉維爾，我也沒睡好......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "哈？你這樣還能算是阿達克利斯？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "阿達克利斯......嗚嗚，嘉維爾果然已經忘了我們原本的名字了......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "嗯？哦，我都忘了。是提亞卡烏才對。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "自從離開這裡後，提亞卡烏這個詞好久沒用過了。博士，你也記一下，在我們這裡，是不按種族區分自己的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "從種族上區分的話，我想想啊，我是阿達克利斯，祖瑪瑪那傢伙是斐迪亞，還有黎博利......嗯，大概有這三種吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "不過在這裡，我們都自稱提亞卡烏，在我們的語言中是“驍勇善戰的人”的意思。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "然後，雖然感覺你應該用不著，不過我們自己稱呼這裡是叫做阿卡胡拉，在我們的語言中是“茂林叢生之地”的意思。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "好了，別哭哭啼啼的，把你的手下也都叫起來，該出發了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "嗚嗚嗚......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "羅德島，博士。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "哦，對了，公司的意思就是......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "啊，我知道的，因為嘉維爾離開後，我有在瞭解外面的資訊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "哦？這麼說來，你的打扮確實也和以前不一樣了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "嗯，這可是外面非常流行的裝扮呢！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "我不懂時尚，是這樣嗎，博士？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "在雜誌上看到過。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "博士果然也看過嗎！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "嘉維爾，你的朋友不太懂時尚的樣子呢。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "我不知道。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "哈哈，博士也有不知道的時候啊。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "對了，特米米，先給博士介紹一下我們這裡吧。我離開了這麼久，也不知道有沒有變化。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "好的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "唔，讓我想想，要給外面的人講的話......對了，要從部族開始呢。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "看看這張地圖，這裡是嘉維爾到達的地方，這裡是我們過來的路徑。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "這一大片叢林覆蓋的區域就是阿卡胡拉了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "生活在阿卡胡拉的所有大大小小部族，根據傳統，每隔一段時間，就會透過祭典的方式選出一名大酋長。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "啊，祭典的方式就是打鬥，誰能戰勝所有挑戰者並贏得其他人的認可就能獲得挑戰現任大酋長的權利。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "戰勝現任大酋長的話，就能成為新的大酋長。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "大酋長的權力的話，唔，所有部族都會聽他的話！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "這不是基本沒什麼變化嘛。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "有的哦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "前任的胡安大酋長因為太喜歡喝酒被老婆追殺到懸崖邊跳下去再也沒有回來，本來上一次的祭典是要選出繼任的大酋長的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "但是，因為嘉維爾的關係，上次沒有選出大酋長，而嘉維爾離開後，各個部族都互相不服氣。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "所以現在各個部族之間陷入了互相鬥爭的狀態。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "上一任大酋長......？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "唔？這在我們這裡是很常見的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "據我阿爹說，胡安大酋長是當大酋長當的很久的一個了，一般大酋長兩三年就會換掉。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "只要大酋長沒了，就舉辦祭典選出一個新的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "因為嘉維爾的關係？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "啊？哦，對，這事我確實沒跟羅德島的人說過。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "我當時把祭典上所有人都打了一頓然後就走了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "因為被排擠？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "所有人？！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "對啊，我當時很氣，就把他們都打了一頓。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "算了，這個先不提，現在有什麼厲害的部族嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "嗯。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "現在有幾個部族比較厲害。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "第一個就是祖瑪瑪作為頭領的森蚺部族。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "她把部族的位置設立在雨林的另一端，靠近礦脈的地方，佔據著大部分的金屬資源。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "他們部族一直喜歡製造一些奇怪的道具和武器，吞併了周圍不少小部族。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "第二個是克瑪爾的燧石部族。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "雨林裡的提亞卡烏不像我們一樣結成部族生活，他們生活的更加分散一些，平時也不和我們交流。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "但是現在，因為失去了大酋長的約束，不少部族進入了雨林，於是雨林中現在也有不少部族了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "克瑪爾現在就是其中之一。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "他們信奉自身的力量，也是佔領了一塊地盤。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "還有一個部族比較特殊，嘉維爾你也認識，是依娜姆的部族。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "她的部族就叫“依娜姆商會”，這個部族的人比較奇怪，他們都不太喜歡打架，反而喜歡和人做生意。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "不過他們的人數不少，不可以小看他們。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "祖瑪瑪那傢伙會把部族設在礦山邊我倒是能想像，那傢伙從那時候起，就很喜歡自己做些武器什麼的了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "沒想到她現在也是一族的頭目，“森蚺”，聽起來不錯啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "嗯，祖瑪瑪的森蚺部族現在也是最強盛的部族，大家都覺得她一定是下一任酋長了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "那傢伙從以前起就很能幹嘛。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "那個，嘉維爾果然不打算當大酋長嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "是啊，我現在在外面有要做的事。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "對吧，博士？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "嗯。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "這樣啊......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
              "text": "唔，該說嘉維爾是直接好呢，還是殘忍好呢......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "你也可以留下來。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "text": "嘿，有一天我會回到這裡的，但不是現在。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "不過你在信裡不是說你也要競爭酋長，而且很有信心嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "嗯，嗯！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "我也做過了充足的準備了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "那我就期待你的表現了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "嗯？好像有打鬥的聲音？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "在那邊，過去看看。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
          "text": "你說不說！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
          "text": "不說！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
          "text": "嘖，還挺有骨氣。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "哦，在打架呢。博士，不用管了，我們繼續走了，常有的事。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
          "text": "你完了，細尾巴的，今天我非要讓你承認是粗尾巴比較好不可！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
          "text": "你做夢！我是不可能屈服的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "嗯？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "喂，那邊那個誰，你說什麼？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
          "text": "什麼人，難道你也是細尾巴部族的？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "雖然我不是，但是你是不是覺得粗尾巴比較好？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
          "text": "啊？那當然！你瞧瞧我的尾巴，強壯、有力、飽滿，還有什麼比這樣一條粗尾巴更好的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "嘖，這我可不能當做沒聽到了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "看看我的細尾巴，苗條、精緻、線條分明，還能提東西！這才叫尾巴！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
          "text": "沒錯，細尾巴才是最好的！咳、咳！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
          "text": "哈？你這種尾巴，藏在屁股後面根本就看不見好吧！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "你這種尾巴才是，長這麼粗坐都坐不好吧！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "他們在吵什麼？",
          "value": "1",
